{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00496",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.84,
      "end_seconds": 4.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "So, good morning, how are you doing today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.08,
      "end_seconds": 9.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.69,
      "text": "hello is it it okay if I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 11.29,
      "end_seconds": 14.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "What made you decide to come in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 17.67,
      "end_seconds": 27.98,
      "duration_seconds": 10.31,
      "text": "I'm here cos of itching all over. I've never really been one for hospitals. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.04,
      "end_seconds": 32.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "What medicines are you taking at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.28,
      "end_seconds": 44.37,
      "duration_seconds": 10.09,
      "text": "Um, I take hydrocortisone cream, when needed for the eczema. I'm supposed to take it regularly, but I don't always manage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.72,
      "end_seconds": 48.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "how intense does it it get?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.06,
      "end_seconds": 52.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Pretty mild, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.52,
      "end_seconds": 55.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "How often does it happen?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.72,
      "end_seconds": 62.92,
      "duration_seconds": 6.2,
      "text": "It happens once or twice a day. And welts that move around, too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.76,
      "end_seconds": 65.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "Any hives as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.0,
      "end_seconds": 70.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Yeah. About a week, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.7,
      "end_seconds": 74.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Okay, what makes it worse, if anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.76,
      "end_seconds": 77.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Heat definitely sets it off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.66,
      "end_seconds": 94.37,
      "duration_seconds": 6.71,
      "text": "let me check a few things any joint pain, throat tightness, trouble breathing or new medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.38,
      "end_seconds": 98.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "No, I'd have mentioned it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.25,
      "end_seconds": 102.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "has there been any wheezing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.29,
      "end_seconds": 106.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "No, um, none, no wheezing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.98,
      "end_seconds": 108.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "And And then?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.93,
      "end_seconds": 113.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "Have you noticed any weakness, or anything odd with your balance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.51,
      "end_seconds": 117.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "no weakness or anything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.95,
      "end_seconds": 122.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "So, is your urine normal, no changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.87,
      "end_seconds": 124.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "No changes there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.5,
      "end_seconds": 140.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.92,
      "end_seconds": 161.37,
      "duration_seconds": 19.45,
      "text": "I gave up drinking about three years ago. I used to smoke but I quit five years ago. I share a flat with two friends. Retired. I stopped a few years back. I play badminton on Sundays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.02,
      "end_seconds": 168.14,
      "duration_seconds": 5.12,
      "text": "What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.74,
      "end_seconds": 181.89,
      "duration_seconds": 10.15,
      "text": "I have eczema. Asthma, for nearly five years it's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.92,
      "end_seconds": 186.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Do you have any known allergies at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.53,
      "end_seconds": 196.33,
      "duration_seconds": 8.8,
      "text": "I think I reacted to some antibiotic once, years ago. I don't remember which one, or what happened exactly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.31,
      "end_seconds": 201.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "First the numbers, if you don't mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.43,
      "end_seconds": 217.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "rest your hand here.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.19,
      "end_seconds": 235.72,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 120 over 78, pulse 70, SpO2 97 percent on room air."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.99,
      "end_seconds": 240.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "come over here and I'll have a look"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.66,
      "end_seconds": 243.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "Let me press here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.96,
      "end_seconds": 265.2,
      "duration_seconds": 5.24,
      "text": "There are raised pink welts on the chest and back, some joined together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.27,
      "end_seconds": 268.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Almost done with this part."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.52,
      "end_seconds": 288.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "Lips look a little puffy, but the tongue and throat are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.29,
      "end_seconds": 294.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "Thanks for that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.89,
      "end_seconds": 324.37,
      "duration_seconds": 18.48,
      "text": "right, here's what I'm thinking it points towards acute urticaria, possibly allergic that's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more another possibility is a viral trigger let's get an allergy test, for recurrent urticaria"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 325.87,
      "end_seconds": 329.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "I can book that for Tuesday at 2 pm"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 330.44,
      "end_seconds": 333.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Tuesday, that works for me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.52,
      "end_seconds": 364.87,
      "duration_seconds": 30.35,
      "text": "I think blood tests makes sense here, for urticaria. You'll be taking levocetirizine, 5 milligrams, once a day, for two weeks. You take it by mouth. That's for hives. Write down anything new you ate, took or used before this started, even small things. Cut back on tea, coffee and fizzy drinks for a couple of weeks and see how things settle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 366.09,
      "end_seconds": 381.54,
      "duration_seconds": 15.45,
      "text": "If your lips or tongue swell more, or you have trouble breathing, that's the point to come in urgently. Let me check I've been clear. What will you do once you get home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 382.44,
      "end_seconds": 389.25,
      "duration_seconds": 6.81,
      "text": "so, I take the levocetirizine, 5 milligrams, once a day. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 391.29,
      "end_seconds": 394.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Thanks for coming in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 395.54,
      "end_seconds": 400.78,
      "duration_seconds": 5.24,
      "text": "okay, so no, I think that's everything thank you, doctor"
    }
  ]
}